 Johto’s Radio Tower was\\ntaken over by a criminal gang,\\fwe have had to step up our security.","msg_0482_T05R0701_00002":"Many people are hard at work here\\nin the Radio Tower.\\rThey must be doing their best to put\\non good shows.","msg_0482_T05R0701_00003":"Oh, no, no, no!\\rWe’ve been off the air ever since the\\nPower Plant shut down.\\rAll my efforts to start this station\\nwould be wasted if I can’t broadcast.\\fI’ll be ruined!","msg_0482_T05R0701_00004":"Ah! So you’re the {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} who\\nsolved the Power Plant’s problem?\\rThanks to you, I never lost my job.\\nI tell you, you’re a real lifesaver!\\fPlease take this as my thanks.\\r","msg_0482_T05R0701_00005":"Ah! So you’re the {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} who\\nsolved the Power Plant’s problem?\\rThanks to you, I never lost my job.\\nI tell you, you’re a real lifesaver!\\fPlease take this as my thanks.\\r","msg_0482_T05R0701_00006":"The Director loaded the EXPN Card\\non {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Pokégear!\\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Pokégear has been\\nupgraded!","msg_0482_T05R0701_00007":"With that thing, you can tune in to\\neven more radio programs here in\\fKanto.\\fGahahahaha!","msg_0482_T05R0701_00008":"Hey there!\\nI am the super Music Director!\\rHuh? Your Pokégear can’t tune in to my\\nmusic shows.\\rHow unfortunate!\\rIf you upgrade it with the EXPN Card,\\nyou can tune in.\\fYou’d better get one!","msg_0482_T05R0701_00009":"Hey there!\\nI am the super Music Director!\\rI’m responsible for the gorgeous\\nmelodies that go out over the air.\\rDon’t be square. Grab your music\\noff the air!","msg_0482_T05R0701_00010":"1F Reception\\n2F Sales\\f3F Personnel\\f4F Production\\f5F Director’s Office\\n","msg_0482_T05R0701_00011":"Perk Up Pokémon with Mellow Sounds\\nof the Poké Flute.\\rThe Poké Flute broadcast is only\\navailable around the Kanto region.\\rTry to tune in around the upper area\\nof the radio!"},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_T05R0701_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_T05R0701_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_T05R0701_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_T05R0701_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_T05R0701_004":4,"_EV_scr_seq_T05R0701_005":5,"_EV_scr_seq_T05R0701_006":6,"obj_T05R0701_gswoman6":0,"obj_T05R0701_policeman":1,"obj_T05R0701_gsgentleman":2,"obj_T05R0701_gsman1":3,"obj_T05R0701_gsman1_2":4,"obj_T05R0701_gsgentleman_2":5}}
